atural results. It’s also **much faster than Adobe Photoshop’s Generative Fill Expand**, and unlike Photoshop, you can run the entire process **fully offline inside ComfyUI**.\n\n**RBG Pad Pro** handles the heavy lifting, intelligent padding, context‑aware expansion, and seamless integration with Flux‑based edit models, but also free to experiment with other models.\n\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Guide: [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n## Model links (for local users)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors)\n\n**Recommended - Works better with Outpainting**\n\n- [flux-2-klein-9b-kv.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv/blob/main/flux-2-klein-9b-kv.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n**ComfyUI-RBG-ImageStitchPlus**\n\n- [ComfyUI-RBG-ImageStitchPlus](https://github.com/RamonGuthrie/ComfyUI-RBG-ImageStitchPlus)\n\n\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_4b.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nThis workflow is a **fast, smart outpainting system powered by my RBG Pad Pro 🛠️ node**.\n\nIt makes **outpainting and aspect‑ratio changes extremely simple**, letting you expand any image in any direction with clean, natural results. It’s also **much faster than Adobe Photoshop’s Generative Fill Expand**, and unlike Photoshop, you can run the entire process **fully offline inside ComfyUI**.\n\n**RBG Pad Pro** han